+```text
+Customer / Agent / CI
+  -> Yalla Control Plane API
+  -> Postgres source of truth
+  -> Provisioning worker
+  -> private Dokploy API
+```
+
+Customers must never receive Dokploy API tokens, database URLs, signing keys,
+secret-encryption keys, API keys, cookies, or rendered environment values.
+
